            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1031-f3" n="35" xml:id="d1031-f3-content">
                <p>Col. Serafín M. Montesinos, Assistant Chief of Staff, Intelligence Section,
                    Caribbean Defense Command.</p>
            </note>
